# mrefd interlink file.
# Peer-reflector entries. mrefd hot-reloads on change.
#
# UDP forms (legacy interlink):
#   M17-QQQ  ABC                          DHT-based peer discovery
#   M17-URF  45.32.11.22  17000  BCD      static IP/port
#   M17-QQQL 44.45.45.100 ABC             pre-1.0 "legacy L" peer
#
# TLS forms (field nodes linking to a hub). The tls-* scripts write these;
# you don't need to type them. Modules may be written B,C or BC.
#   Hub: one line per field operator's key (tls-add-peer). Their nodes may
#   each link one of these modules, and appear here as W5ABC-B, W5ABC-C.
#   Changes apply within seconds, including disconnecting revoked nodes.
#     W5ABC    B,C  key:/etc/mrefd/tls/peers/W5ABC.pub.pem
#   Field node: one line per hub (tls-add-hub), linking ONE module.
#   Restart the node after changing it.
#     M17-HUB  B    tls:hub.example.org:17000  servercert:/etc/mrefd/tls/hubs/M17-HUB.crt
